{{#if approved}}
{{> header title="Your product is approved" subtitle="It can go live now" }}
{{else}}
{{> header title="Your product needs changes" subtitle="It is not live yet" }}
{{/if}}

<p>Hello <strong>{{vendorName}}</strong>,</p>

{{#if approved}}
<p><strong>{{productName}}</strong> has been reviewed and approved. It can
    appear in the storefront as soon as its status is set to active.</p>

{{> button url=productsUrl text="View your products" }}
{{else}}
<p><strong>{{productName}}</strong> was reviewed and cannot go live as it
    stands. It has been moved back to draft, so nothing of yours has been
    deleted — edit it and submit again.</p>

<div class="security-note" style="background: #fff8e1; border-left-color: #f59e0b;">
    <p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-weight: 700;">Why</p>
    <p style="margin: 0;">{{reason}}</p>
</div>

{{> button url=productsUrl text="Edit this product" }}

<p style="margin-top: 8px;">If you think this was a mistake, reply through
    support and a person will look at it again.</p>
{{/if}}

<p style="margin-top: 28px;">Thank you,<br>The {{companyName}} Team</p>
